      "message": "GTPv2: Assosiate IMSI with all packets in session\n\nAt present to filter all packets related to UE first need filter by IMSI\nthen get session IDs and make filter including these sessions.\nThere may be several sessions: MME-SGW, SGW-PGW\n\nIf this changes will be merged, I will try to add the same function\nto DIAMETER and GTP (now only interesting these two protocols)\n",
